    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG GLEN CORCORAN are delighted to bring to the market 1 Breathnach Court, a spacious and well maintained 3 bedroom home located in a small residential development of just 6 house. Situated only minutes walk from Ferbane Town Centre, the property is in good condition both internally & externally and is ready for immediate occupation. Consisting of c. 98 sq.m/1,054sq.ft,, accommodation briefly includes: Entrance Hall, Kitchen, Sitting Room, 3 Bedrooms (1 En-Suite), Main Bathroom & WC Bathroom. The property also has the benefit of a private rear garden with garden shed and off street parking. \r\n\r\nAll of Ferbane's services & amenities including Primary & Secondary Schools, Sports Clubs, Supermarket, Post Office, Pubs, Restaurants, Takeaways etc are within easy walking distance. The larger towns of Athlone, Tullamore & Birr are also within easy reach, with a good local public transport service available.\r\n\r\nThis property offers excellent potential and is sure to appeal to both owner occupiers and investors alike. Viewing is highly recommended through sole selling agents, DNG GLEN CORCORAN"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 3.20m x 1.82m\r\nBright Entrance Hall with tiled flooring and is tastefully decorated\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 5.81m x 3.47\r\nSpacious Sitting Room with laminated timber flooring, roller blinds to window, open fireplace and double door leading to kitchen\r\n\r\nKitchen - 5.40m x 3.61m\r\nGood selection of wall & base units, tiled splashback, tiled floors, roller blinds to windows, french doors leading to rear garden and double doors leading to Sitting Room\r\n\r\nWC - 1.70m x 1.37m\r\nWC, WHB, Tiled Floors\r\n\r\nLanding - 3.40m x 2.15\r\nSpacious light filled landing with carpet to floors\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.43m x 3.86m\r\nSpacious double bedroom with laminated timber flooring, built in wardrobes & en-suite bathroom\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 2.00m x 1.85m\r\nTiled floors and part tiled walls, WC, WHB & Shower Enclosure with Triton Electric Shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.96m x 4.00m\r\nSpacious double bedroom with laminated timber flooring & built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.28m x 2.31m\r\nSpacious 3rd Bedroom comes with with laminated timber flooring & built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.18m x 1.91m\r\nFamily Bathroom with tiled floors and part tiled walls, WC, WHB & Bath."
      },
      {
