        "Content": "Energy Efficient 'B' BER Rating\r\nIn Good Condition both Internally & Externally\r\nTown Centre Location\r\nPrimary & Secondary Schools within easy walking distance.\r\nAthlone c. 20 minutes.\r\nOil Fired Central Heating"
